        "content": "**Current collection policy:** compact backend summaries are unsampled; traces default to 5%; browser sessions default to 10% after analytics consent. This is the repository policy, not a readback of deployment settings. See [Telemetry health](/d/phaseo-telemetry) for actual event arrival.\n\n**Best next coverage:** external HTTP checks for website, gateway and web API health; retained traces for request diagnosis; private source maps for readable browser errors. Two public probes checking three endpoints every five minutes use at most **53,568 API executions in 31 days**, plus logs and metrics. Avoid generation endpoints, customer calls and high-cardinality metric labels such as request IDs.\n\nCheck usage before and after raising collection, leaving about 20% headroom. Budget colors do not stop exporters. Alerts and mobile/Slack delivery must be configured separately."
